"The Nine-edged Son Whose Own Mother Forsakes Him is Knight Esh-erdi's flying nonagon."
"It is translucent green, textured like a stroopwafel, and seats about four."
"A resizing green ring steers it: point to steer, extend the arm to speed, press 'soothe' to descend."
"Rotating the ring right glues its wearer in place; its name is said aloud to show it respect."
